       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TEST-TX01.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 TX01-RECEIVE.
   COPY "COMMON-RECEIVE.cpy".
   COPY "TX01-RECEIVE.cpy".

01 TX01-RESPONSE.
   COPY "COMMON-RESPONSE.cpy".
   COPY "TX01-RESPONSE.cpy".

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    INITIALIZE TX01-RECEIVE
               TX01-RESPONSE

    MOVE "TX01" TO RCV-TRAN-CODE
    MOVE 20261107 TO RCV-TRAN-DATE
    MOVE 121500 TO RCV-TRAN-TIME
    MOVE "T001" TO RCV-TRAN-TELLER-TERMINAL
    MOVE 1 TO RCV-TRAN-SEQUENCE

    MOVE "0100000000001" TO RCV-ACCOUNT-NUMBER
    MOVE 50000 TO RCV-AMOUNT

    MOVE RCV-TRAN-CODE TO RSP-TRAN-CODE

    DISPLAY "Transaction: " RSP-TRAN-CODE
    DISPLAY "Date: " RCV-TRAN-DATE
    DISPLAY "Amount: " RCV-AMOUNT
    DISPLAY "Initial status: " RSP-STATUS-CODE
    DISPLAY "Initial balance: " RSP-ACCOUNT-BALANCE
    DISPLAY "Receive length: "
        LENGTH OF TX01-RECEIVE
    DISPLAY "Response length: "
        LENGTH OF TX01-RESPONSE

    STOP RUN.